{"data":[{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-10T05:18:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108789248619098515"],"id":"2108789248619098515","in_reply_to_user_id":"2093646888264478721","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3374,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108789038312210575","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"今生若是同淋雪，此生也是共白头","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2108789248619098515"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-10T05:17:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108789038312210575"],"id":"2108789038312210575","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":6951,"like_count":35,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":7},"text":"我好喜欢下雪天呀","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2108789038312210575"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-10T05:07:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108786507586896066"],"id":"2108786507586896066","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":83,"impression_count":39398,"like_count":1365,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":29,"retweet_count":63},"text":"做爱就是要有爱做着才爽啊😡想象一下他在床上恨不得把你当飞机杯一样玩坏，但嘴里却一直喊着：“好爱你啊宝宝，好乖的宝宝”\n结束后又是抱去洗澡又是换床单的，收拾完之后互相相拥在一起，对对方说有多爱多爱对方……没有aftercare的做爱，没有爱的做爱都是不完美的😡","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2108786507586896066"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-10T05:04:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108785728176238848"],"id":"2108785728176238848","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":13133,"like_count":278,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":8},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108611343150456969","type":"quoted"}],"text":"我：我是sub\n某些男性看到的：我是免费飞机杯\n然后私信我：骚母狗来给爸爸免费送逼 https://t.co/fhVW0jYqMv","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2108785728176238848"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-10T05:01:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108784997091971227"],"id":"2108784997091971227","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":228,"impression_count":63870,"like_count":982,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":36,"retweet_count":9},"text":"［被爸爸发现偷看黄片之后给爸爸献上了初夜］（含伪父女，长篇预警）\n好想舔……我抬头渴求着他：“爸爸，贱奴好想给您舔”\n“乖”他微喘着：“摇摇屁股，学狗叫，就给你舔”\n“汪汪！”我学得有模有样，屁股也笨拙地摇摆了起来。\n“舔吧”\n我有些紧张地张开嘴，用舌头认真的舔舐着，用嘴学着视频里那样吮吸着。 https://t.co/npfHVRfcXV","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2108784997091971227"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-10T04:37:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108778938923425825"],"id":"2108778938923425825","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3800,"like_count":20,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"写了一段2149字的伪父女po文不知道有没有人看（担心太长&gt;&lt;）","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2108778938923425825"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-09T16:19:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108593314111115358"],"id":"2108593314111115358","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":88,"impression_count":56414,"like_count":1674,"quote_count":38,"reply_count":43,"retweet_count":89},"text":"哥哥和爸爸就是不一样的啊……哥哥有一种青涩感，清爽的年上感。爸爸有一种粗壮感，很有经验的样子，严厉沉稳的年上感……\n但是更爽的是，如果谈到哥哥了，谈久点等到哥哥变成爸爸就可以品鉴两份美味了……","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2108593314111115358"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-09T16:17:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108592732474396826"],"id":"2108592732474396826","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":28,"impression_count":28750,"like_count":195,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":21,"retweet_count":1},"text":"因为学过舞蹈所以现在看所有和舞蹈有关的调教玩法（如裸体跳舞塞跳蛋）都会萎。","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2108592732474396826"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-09T16:04:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108589404898078978"],"id":"2108589404898078978","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":4499,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"你们骗我，送别的时候才没有晚风拂柳笛声残，夕阳山外山","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2108589404898078978"},{"author_id":"2093646888